<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<br><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b><font face="arial">A Product Access Request (PAR) Line Item has been submitted to your Organization and requires Approval or Rejection by one of your Support Org Admins.</font></b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br><div align="center"><font color="#666666"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">_______________________________________________________________</b></font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br><div align="center"><b>PAR Line Item Details</b><br></div><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="2" face="arial"><strong>Approval Support Org:</strong> {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_Support_Org_Name__c}<span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"></span></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="2" face="arial"><b>PAR #:</b> {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_MAP_PAR__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="2" face="arial"><b>Line Item #:</b> {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Name}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="2"><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" face="arial"><b>Line Item Approval Status:</b>&nbsp;</font><font color="#ff0000">{!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_Line_Item_Approval_Status__c}</font></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="2" face="arial"><b>Account:</b> {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_Account__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial"><font size="2"><b>Account Geo:</b>&nbsp;{!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_Account_Geo__c}</font></font></div><div><font style="font-family: arial;" face="arial"><font size="2"><b>Account Sub Geo:</b>&nbsp;{!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_Account_Sub_Geo__c}</font></font></div><div><font size="2"><b style="font-family: arial;">Supported Product:</b><span style="font-family: arial;"> {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_Supported_Product_Name__c}</span></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;" face="arial"><font size="2"><font size="2" face="arial"><strong>Submitter:</strong> {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.CreatedBy}</font></font></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;" face="arial"><font size="2"><strong>Submitter Comments:</strong> {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_Submitter_Comments__c}</font></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial"><br></font>&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b><font face="arial">To Approve or Reject this PAR Line Item please: <a href="{!$Label.Core_IPS_Notification_Internal_URL}/{!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Id}">Click Here</a><a href="https://shnintelqacs44crm.intelqa.shnpoc.net/{!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Id}"><br></a></font></b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br>&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">If you would like to view a report of all pending PAR Line Items for your Org, please follow this link: <a href="{!$Label.Core_IPS_Pending_PAR_Report_URL}?pv1={!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_Approving_Product_Organization__c}">Click Here</a></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">NOTE: If a&nbsp;Product Access Request was submitted with multiple Line Items you will receive one email for each Line Item requiring approval.<br><br></font><font color="#666666"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">_______________________________________________________________</b></font><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: medium;"><div style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><font size="1" face="arial" color="#666666"><b><br></b></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><font size="1" face="arial" color="#666666"><b>This message contains Intel Confidential information and should be handled in accordance with your Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) with Intel. Access to this e-mail by anyone other than the intended recipient is unauthorized. If you are not the intended recipient (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not use, copy, distribute, or deliver this message or any part of its contents or take any action in reliance on it, and in such case, you should destroy this message.</b></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><font size="1" face="arial" color="#666666"><b><br></b></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><b style="text-align: center; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: x-small;"></b></p><div><font size="1" color="#666666"><b>Copyright ©Intel Corporation. All rights reserved. Intel Corporation, 2200 Mission College Blvd., M/S RNB4-145, Santa Clara, CA 95054-1549 USA www.intel.com (408) 765-8080</b></font></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
